Jude Shin (jshin53@calpoly.edu)

All parts of this program were completed.

I built off the code given for program 3, but I started making more changes 
that will be implemented in my final project. The main milestone that I wanted 
to complete was the maze generation. The wall object and texture was added in 
program 3, and I am just going to use that as a unit of measurement for one 
"wall".

To change views from FPS mode to Birds-Eye-View, press "m". This will change 
the camera angle.
